---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Project Clandestinus" description="Project Clandestinus is an independent creative and publishing venture in the Creative & Cultural Innovation branch of the Tree of Life ecosystem.">
  <section class="hero archive">
    <p class="eyebrow">Creative &amp; Cultural Innovation · Tree of Life</p>
    <p class="archiveMark" aria-hidden="true">✦ ◇ ✦</p>
    <h1>A book. A code. A world built to be discovered.</h1>
    <p class="lead">Project Clandestinus is an independent creative and publishing venture built around mystery, hidden symbols, coded messages, reader participation and discovery.</p>
    <div class="actions"><a class="btn primary" href="https://projectclandestinus.com">Visit Project Clandestinus</a><a class="btn" href="/tree-of-life">Explore the Tree of Life</a></div>
  </section>

  <section class="panel"><h2>More than a traditional book</h2><p>Clandestinus invites readers to examine a story as well as follow it: looking for symbols, patterns, visual codes and layered mysteries; testing interpretations; and uncovering what may sit beneath the visible surface.</p><div class="tags"><span>Symbolic manuscripts</span><span>Hidden patterns</span><span>Visual codes</span><span>Decoding challenges</span><span>Shared discovery</span><span>Future artefacts &amp; experiences</span></div></section>

  <section class="grid"><article class="panel"><p class="eyebrow">Book I</p><h2>The First Gate</h2><p>The opening symbolic manuscript invites readers to study signs, patterns, placement and structure — and investigate whether a deeper message exists within the work.</p><p class="note">A future reward and verification framework is being developed but is not activated. Participation, eligibility, verification, funding and any future reward remain subject to official rules and activation notices.</p><a class="textLink" href="https://projectclandestinus.com/book">Discover Book I →</a></article><article class="panel archiveSide"><p class="eyebrow">The wider world</p><h2>A growing creative universe</h2><p>Future possibilities include further books, deeper coded structures, physical artefacts, collector editions, verified discovery stages and carefully developed interactive or immersive experiences.</p><p class="note">Each expansion is subject to its own development, feasibility, funding and legal requirements.</p></article></section>

  <section><div class="sectionHead"><p class="eyebrow">Why it belongs in Tree of Life</p><h2>Independent venture. Shared purpose.</h2><p>Project Clandestinus explores imagination, participation and discovery as the Creative &amp; Cultural Innovation branch of Tree of Life. It may create creative and commercial value — while remaining independent from Visio Nova Mundi CIC.</p></div><div class="benefits"><article><h3>Curiosity &amp; critical thinking</h3><p>Decoding encourages attention to detail, evidence and interpretation.</p></article><article><h3>Active reading</h3><p>Readers are invited to interact with a book rather than consume it passively.</p></article><article><h3>Shared discovery</h3><p>A mystery world can connect readers, puzzle-solvers, collectors and creative communities.</p></article></div></section>

  <section class="boundary"><h2>Legal, financial and operational separation</h2><p>Project Clandestinus remains a separate commercial and creative intellectual-property venture. Its inclusion in Tree of Life does not transfer its ownership, intellectual property, publishing activities, finances, contracts, reward or prize obligations, or legal responsibilities to Visio Nova Mundi CIC.</p><p>Likewise, grants, sponsorship or other funding received by Visio Nova Mundi CIC do not automatically finance Project Clandestinus. If the founder independently chooses to provide financial or in-kind support to the CIC and its public-benefit work, that support would be separately documented and subject to appropriate governance. It is not automatic, guaranteed or attached to every book sale.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn primary" href="https://projectclandestinus.com">Enter the archive</a><a class="btn" href="/impact">Read the impact approach</a></div></section>

  <style>
